          "returnType": null,
          "description": "Let the browser show its own context menu over the canvas. Default false - a right-click is normally a game input, not a request for the browser's menu. Independent of the engine's own contextmenu event, which is routed through the scene graph either way."
        },
        {
          "name": "allowTextSelection",
